{"id":"30c9fe5076745a2a","group":"20","path":"20/20-lem-tree-derived-class.md","title":"树的有限路径剪枝对应闭类导集","display":"lem-tree-derived-class — 树的有限路径剪枝对应闭类导集","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-lem-tree-derived-class","aliases":["20-lem-tree-derived-class"],"display":"lem-tree-derived-class — 树的有限路径剪枝对应闭类导集","chapter":"8","section":"8.7","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Definitions 8.7.5–8.7.6；Exercise 8.7.7","source_printed_pages":[172],"source_pdf_pages":[205],"depends_on":["[[20-df-tree]]","[[20-df-cantor-bendixson]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-lem-tree-derived-class"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-lem-tree-derived-class</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-tree-derived-class — 树的有限路径剪枝对应闭类导集"},{"key":"chapter","html":"8"},{"key":"section","html":"8.7"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Definitions 8.7.5–8.7.6；Exercise 8.7.7"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>172</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>205</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"93a810534b87b0f9\" href=\"?note=93a810534b87b0f9\" title=\"20-df-tree\">20-df-tree</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"14fc2af0ac27dcbb\" href=\"?note=14fc2af0ac27dcbb\" title=\"20-df-cantor-bendixson\">20-df-cantor-bendixson</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq2^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(T\\subseteq2^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span> 是树；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma(T)=\\{\\sigma\\in T:|[T_\\sigma]|&lt;\\omega\\}\">\\(\\Gamma(T)=\\{\\sigma\\in T:|[T_\\sigma]|&lt;\\omega\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T^-=T\\setminus\\Gamma(T)\">\\(T^-=T\\setminus\\Gamma(T)\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"93a810534b87b0f9\" href=\"?note=93a810534b87b0f9\" title=\"20-df-tree\">20-df-tree</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"14fc2af0ac27dcbb\" href=\"?note=14fc2af0ac27dcbb\" title=\"20-df-cantor-bendixson\">20-df-cantor-bendixson</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}tree-derived-class}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Tree}_2(T^-)\\quad\\land\\quad[T^-]=D([T]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}tree-derived-class}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Tree}_2(T^-)\\quad\\land\\quad[T^-]=D([T]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>子柱有无限路径时，其父柱也有无限路径，所以剪后仍向下闭合。一个路径非孤立，当且仅当其每个柱邻域包含无限多个原路径：若仅有限，可再缩小排除其余点；反向显然。因此恰好所有前缀都保留的路径组成导集。两棵具有相同路径集的树在剪枝后仍有相同路径集，点秩的表示无关性随超限归纳得到。</p>\n<p>来源：Definitions 8.7.5–8.7.6；Exercise 8.7.7；印刷页 172；PDF 第 205 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-tree","status":"resolved","id":"93a810534b87b0f9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-tree]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-cantor-bendixson","status":"resolved","id":"14fc2af0ac27dcbb","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-cantor-bendixson]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-tree","status":"resolved","id":"93a810534b87b0f9","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-tree]]；see [[20-df-cantor-bendixson]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-cantor-bendixson","status":"resolved","id":"14fc2af0ac27dcbb","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-tree]]；see [[20-df-cantor-bendixson]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T\\subseteq2^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma(T)=\\{\\sigma\\in T:|[T_\\sigma]|<\\omega\\}","display":false},{"tex":"T^-=T\\setminus\\Gamma(T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}tree-derived-class}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Tree}_2(T^-)\\quad\\land\\quad[T^-]=D([T]).","display":true}],"bytes":1458,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["93a810534b87b0f9","14fc2af0ac27dcbb"]}